🧩 1. Problem Definition

You are building a Todo Backend API that allows users to:

Create todos --- post /todos

get single todo --- get /todos/:id

Read todos   ---- get /todos

Update todos ---- put /todos/:id

Delete todos ---- delete /todos/:id


⚙️ 2. Core Features (MVP)

These are non-negotiable basics:

📝 Todo Features

Create a todo

Get all todos

Get single todo by ID

Update todo

Delete todo